<p>Every time you or one of your minions kill a creature you create a temporary link to the place of death.</p><p>For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 6</acronym> turns afterwards you can instantly and accurately teleport to it (if it is in sight).</p><p></p>